\b FS Platform Model Handover V1.5.0a Aero Parser Debug Fix \b0\par
\par
\b Purpose \b0\par
This document records a blocker-level V1.5.0a fix. The goal was not to extend tire-layer capability, but to repair the earlier aero interpolation parser/debug failure that stopped both V1.5 demos before they could enter the tire layer.\par
\par
\b Problem Location \b0\par
Blocking file: aero/interp_aero_map.m\par
Original failure: illegal use of reserved keyword end\par
Call chain: demo_tire_table_* -> run_case -> solve_equilibrium -> residual_equilibrium -> calc_external_loads -> calc_aero_state -> interp_aero_map\par
\par
\b Core Fixes \b0\par
1. Removed the corrupted first-line character issue that effectively turned the file header into ifunction.\par
2. Reworked interp_aero_map.m into a single-main-function file and removed the trailing local helper function.\par
3. Preserved 4D aero-map interpolation, clamp behavior, linear-to-nearest fallback, and transparent flags.\par
4. Kept pitchMomentTable optional; when absent, pitchMomentExtra remains 0.0.\par
\par
\b Boundaries Kept Intact \b0\par
1. The project was not rebuilt and the directory structure was not changed.\par
2. The main chain run_case -> validate -> preprocess -> solve -> postprocess was not changed.\par
3. The V1.5 tire proxy layer was not pushed back into the main equilibrium solver.\par
4. Aero map behavior was not replaced by constant placeholders.\par
\par
\b Main Files Updated \b0\par
aero/interp_aero_map.m\par
core/calc_aero_state.m\par
tests/test_aero_map_flags.m\par
tests/test_interp_aero_map_basic.m\par
tests/test_interp_aero_map_clamp_flags.m\par
tests/test_interp_aero_map_no_pitch_table.m\par
tests/test_interp_aero_map_fallback_nearest.m\par
README.md\par
\par
\b Verification \b0\par
The four new direct aero interpolation tests passed. test_aero_map_flags continued to pass. demo_tire_table_pure_lateral and demo_tire_table_brake_in_turn both passed the original aero blocker and entered the tire layer. The remaining tire-table out-of-range warning is non-blocking.\par
\par
\b Packaging Note \b0\par
Temporary runtime folders such as .matlab_env, .matlab_prefs, and .tmp are not part of the source update and must be excluded from release zip packages.\par
\par
\b Next Step Guidance \b0\par
Keep interp_aero_map.m as a single-main-function file. If V1.5.x continues, prioritize cleaning up non-blocking tire-table out-of-range warnings instead of reopening the aero parser fix.\par
